  One serving issuer in window 1 (F1), enforcement against an issuer that cannot serve in windows 2 and 3. ISSUER-B is registered first and ISSUER-A second, both lots bonded at deploy; after window 1 the operator drains ISSUER-B so later windows route to ISSUER-A. One issuer per window is configuration in this record, never code.
